        "created_at": "2025-10-02T02:41:23.718Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/337150/discussions/0/351660338720975392/\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/8a02e762db5f5d1e6b16a696eb2fdeb94cebe7b0.png\" class=\"site-icon\" data-dominant-color=\"556F8E\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/337150/discussions/0/351660338720975392/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">steamcommunity.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:460/215;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a5cbac0eff189563a3da26b29f649fa8ee7e4016.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" data-dominant-color=\"7D7874\" width=\"460\" height=\"215\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/337150/discussions/0/351660338720975392/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">How To Post Game Logs :: Sentinels of the Multiverse General Discussions</a></h3>\n\n  <p>I saw this asked in a thread. Rather than have new users need to dig through threads for it, I figured it'd be easier to just have a thread dedicated on how to do it. I only know how to do it on Windows, so if anyone would like to post a tutorial on...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Nearly 10-year-old Steam forum thread, but maybe it still works. I’ve never gone looking for the log myself.</p>",
